inal_name\":\"Monster: The Ed Gein Story\",\"overview\":\"The shocking true-life tale of Ed Gein, the infamous murderer and grave robber who inspired many of Hollywood's most iconic on-screen killers.\",\"poster_path\":\"/iDHzRALtZCzHVmx7uyjTTKvMAPB.jpg\",\"media_type\":\"tv\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"genre_ids\":[18,80],\"popularity\":344.2734,\"first_air_date\":\"2025-10-03\",\"vote_average\":7.47,\"vote_count\":116,\"origin_country\":[\"US\"]},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/ScaVfT5IkwVC3Edhmxqyl0GbK0.jpg\",\"id\":205715,\"name\":\"Gen V\",\"original_name\":\"Gen V\",\"overview\":\"At America's only college for superheroes, gifted students put their moral boundaries to the test, competing for the university's top ranking, and a chance to join The Seven, Vought International's elite superhero team. When the school's dark secrets come to light, they must decide what kind of heroes they want to become.\",\"poster_path\":\"/tEv842Nd5uMSavURG4aQO1pNtst.jpg\",\"media_type\":\"tv\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"genre_ids\":[10759,18,10765],\"popularity\":101.3117,\"first_air_date\":\"2023-09-28\",\"vote_average\":7.711,\"vote_count\":1166,\"origin_country\":[\"US\"]},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/4A74F9J4HBQYDcudi1tyb3Mz0zS.jpg\",\"id\":213402,\"name\":\"Campfire Cooking in Another World with My Absurd Skill\",\"original_name\":\"とんでもスキルで異世界放浪メシ\",\"overview\":\"Tsuyoshi Mukohda, an ordinary salaryman, is suddenly transported to another world one day. The unique skill he gains upon arrival in this world is the seemingly useless \\\"Online Grocery.\\\" Mukohda is discouraged at first, but the modern foods he's able to bring to his new world using this skill prove to have some unbelievable effects!\",\"poster_path\":\"/i9dL4Prs5UImh3YpCgN2DbjYoCg.jpg\",\"media_type\":\"tv\",\"original_language\":\"ja\",\"genre_ids\":[16,10759,10765],\"popularity\":32.9496,\"first_air_date\":\"2023-01-11\",\"vote_average\":8.346,\"vote_count\":240,\"origin_country\":[\"JP\"]},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/3EpIf4C0cM0faMPGWQetTNdQDaH.jpg\",\"id\":237052,\"name\":\"The Lost Station Girls\",\"original_name\":\"Les Disparues de la gare\",\"overview\":\"Between 1995 and 2001 in southern France, a teenage girl vanishes and three young women are murdered—sparking a relentless manhunt that will haunt detective Flore Robin and the Perpignan police for years.\",\"poster_path\":\"/8QQeN8BucSJTwdZPgmPRjTd0PpX.jpg\",\"media_type\":\"tv\",\"original_language\":\"fr\",\"genre_ids\":[80,18],\"popularity\":13.2683,\"first_air_date\":\"2025-10-08\",\"vote_average\":0,\"vote_count\":0,\"origin_country\":[\"FR\"]},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/pj1wFbZF3gpEg7F0EreXTvZNZTG.jpg\",\"id\":110492,\"name\":\"Peacemaker\",\"original_name\":\"Peacemaker\",\"overview\":\"The continuing story of Peacemaker, a vainglorious superhero/supervillain who believes in peace at any cost — no matter how many people he has to kill. After a miraculous recovery from his duel with Bloodsport, Peacemaker soon discovers that his freedom comes at a price.\",\"poster_path\":\"/yb4F1Oocq8GfQt6iIuAgYEBokhG.jpg\",\"media_type\":\"tv\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"genre_ids\":[10759,10765,18],\"popularity\":155.4898,\"first_air_date\":\"2022-01-13\",\"vote_average\":8.222,\"vote_count\":3055,\"origin_country\":[\"US\"]},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/lysUnU6V0VfcthDbviuVlIqgHOR.jpg\",\"id\":120089,\"name\":\"SPY x FAMILY\",\"original_name\":\"SPY×FAMILY\",\"overview\":\"A spy, an assassin and a telepath come together to pose as a family, each for their own reasons, while hiding their true identities from each other.\",\"poster_path\":\"/7NAvPYPAu7MeHwP8E9sn81PqsRh.jpg\",\"media_type\":\"tv\",\"original_language\":\"ja\",\"genre_ids\":[16,35,10759],\"popularity\":62.4264,\"first_air_date\":\"2022-04-09\",\"vote_average\":8.5,\"vote_count\":2094,\"origin_country\":[\"JP\"]},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/l0qVZIpXtIo7km9u5Yqh0nKPOr5.jpg\",\"id\":1668,\"name\":\"Friends\",\"original_name\":\"Friends\",\"overview\":\"Six young people from New York City, on their own and struggling to survive in the real world, find the companionship, comfort and support they get from each other to be the perfect antidote to the pressures of life.\",\"poster_path\":\"/2koX1xLkpTQM4IZebYvKysFW1Nh.jpg\",\"media_type\":\"tv\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"genre_ids\":[35],\"popularity\":59.1807,\"first_air_date\":\"1994-09-22\",\"vote_average\":8.426,\"vote_count\":8603,\"origin_country\":[\"US\"]},\"$c:1:props:randomShow\",{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/t7Q6Z4evj32PIrreppppr2ESN7Z.jpg\",\"id\":242907,\"name\":\"Fate\",\"original_name\":\"La suerte\",\"overview\":\"Taxi driver David becomes the chauffeur for a famous bullfighter known as El Maestro, who is attempting a comeback after years away from the ring. El Maestro's perspective changes, and he starts seeing David as a good luck charm.\",\"poster_path\":\"/uTVhABBMuGUoIy5ttHwUm66lGIs.jpg\",\"media_type\":\"tv\",\"original_language\":\"es\",\"genre_ids\":[35,18],\"popularity\":10.104,\"first_air_date\":\"2025-10-08\",\"vote_average\":0,\"vote_count\":0,\"origin_country\":[\"ES\"]},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/bDfboQUb45Cv9MYyVBDZw8M8xSM.jpg\",\"id\":95480,\"name\":\"Slow Horses\",\"original_name\":\"Slow Horses\",\"overview\":\"Follow a dysfunctional team of MI5 agents—and their obnoxious boss, the notorious Jackson Lamb—as they navigate the espionage world's smoke and mirrors to defend England from sinister forces.\",\"poster_path\":\"/5RuZZIouptatjV96BdPmKmRsnGg.jpg\",\"media_type\":\"tv\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"genre_ids\":[80,18,35],\"popularity\":66.7074,\"first_air_date\":\"2022-04-01\",\"vote_average\":8,\"vote_count\":642,\"origin_country\":[\"GB\"]},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/3AXLSxMuqyZt8HyrKKfrcJtkswD.jpg\",\"id\":63926,\"name\":\"One-Punch Man\",\"original_name\":\"ワンパンマン\",\"overview\":\"Saitama is a hero who only became a hero for fun. After three years of “special” training, though, he's become so strong that he's practically invincible. In fact, he's too strong — even his mightiest opponents are taken out with a single punch, and it turns out that being devastatingly powerful is actually kind of a bore. With his passion for being a hero lost along with his hair, yet still faced with new enemies every day, how much longer can he keep it going?\",\"poster_path\":\"/jbYJuxfZMpYDalkiOnBcCv9TaL.jpg\",\"media_type\":\"tv\",\"original_language\":\"ja\",\"genre_ids\":[16,35,10759,10765],\"popularity\":79.6059,\"first_air_date\":\"2015-10-05\",\"vote_average\":8.398,\"vote_count\":3827,\"origin_country\":[\"JP\"]},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/KQDy2RJMN2gsPV5RZO1pQdFZAQ.jpg\",\"id\":285070,\"name\":\"Ninja vs. Gokudo\",\"original_name\":\"忍者と極道\",\"overview\":\"The ninja banish evil from the shadows. The gokudo gather lonely outcasts and commit crimes. The grudge they forged centuries ago is rekindled in the present day. The ninja Shinoha meets Kiwami, a gokudo with the face of a businessman. Unknowing of the other's identity, they bond over anime, but the war between ninja and gokudo intensifies. Who will survive and who will perish, ninja or gokudo?\",\"poster_path\":\"/zOokyOcW8KtCTkF6Km6KZKABz83.jpg\",\"media_type\":\"tv\",\"original_language\":\"ja\",\"genre_ids\":[16,10759],\"popularity\":7.0719,\"first_air_date\":\"2025-10-08\",\"vote_average\":0,\"vote_count\":0,\"origin_country\":[\"JP\"]},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/vNqDJzm7AR95NpLzDn85dEL84vv.jpg\",\"id\":256920,\"name\":\"Love's Ambition\",\"original_name\":\"许我耀眼\",\"overview\":\"Renowned anchor Xu Yan and urban elite Shen Haoming appear to be the perfect couple but struggle to fit into each other’s social circles due to their differing backgrounds. When conflict arises, Xu Yan leaves, prompting Shen Haoming to realize his deep love for her and attempt to win her back. On their journey, they face challenges, shed their facades, and rediscover their true selves.\",\"poster_path\":\"/iH8J36LMEYdvOlYvbBcYCK0ckpp.jpg\",\"media_type\":\"tv\",\"original_language\":\"zh\",\"genre_ids\":[18],\"popularity\":74.1614,\"first_air_date\":\"2025-09-26\",\"vote_average\":8,\"vote_count\":3,\"origin_country\":[\"CN\"]},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/is3ZdGCPEKTW7IyDe0khvE1nc6R.jpg\",\"id\":225634,\"name\":\"Monsters: The Lyle and Erik Menendez Story\",\"original_name\":\"Monsters: The Lyle and Erik Menendez Story\",\"overview\":\"The story of the Menéndez brothers, who were convicted in 1996 of murdering their parents José and Mary Louise “Kitty” Menéndez.\",\"poster_path\":\"/x9YC2rpXHUFMqI1hCekKDm9UE4w.jpg\",\"media_type\":\"tv\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"genre_ids\":[18,80],\"popularity\":36.0406,\"first_air_date\":\"2024-09-19\",\"vote_average\":7.6,\"vote_count\":408,\"origin_country\":[\"US\"]},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/kxR0LaIF27D6RiyeSdTx0LHRmGA.jpg\",\"id\":286404,\"name\":\"The Dark History of the Reincarnated Villainess\",\"original_name\":\"転生悪女の黒歴史\",\"overview\":\"Konoha Satou has a dark history, written throughout middle school a fantasy adventure of love and magic about the Count's daughter Konoha Magnolia and the knights who love her. But when it looks like that dark history is going to be uncovered by her mother, Konoha panics and dies in a traffic accident. Opening her eyes, she finds that she's been reincarnated into the world of her own dark history as Iana Magnolia, the worst villainess of her own creation.\",\"poster_path\":\"/yrAx1DmfnZjTs2NKsljqd60Kg9X.jpg\",\"media_type\":\"tv\",\"original_language\":\"ja\",\"genre_ids\":[16,35],\"popularity\":4.4542,\"first_air_date\":\"2025-10-09\",\"vote_average\":0,\"vote_count\":0,\"origin_country\":[\"JP\"]},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/mTk3v7maatf4CcMSDZ6x0qBvZa1.jpg\",\"id\":262259,\"name\":\"Wandance\",\"original_name\":\"ワンダンス\",\"overview\":\"Kaboku has always just gone with the flow, marching in step to the drumbeat of the expectations of those around him: parents, school, plans for the future. It feels predictable, safe, and… empty. But one night, Kaboku's at school late, and he happens on a girl alone, moving wildly, turning a blank space of concrete into a canvas. This is Hikari Wanda, a member of the hip-hop dance club. Kaboku is immediately smitten, but the road to stepping out of his shell is a long one. The club is almost entirely girls, and they're all, well, way better than him. What's ahead is unknown, and that's terrifying, but it also means, for the first time in Kaboku's life… a taste of freedom.\",\"poster_path\":\"/1FbU0jXGPTKKWtRkVD1zplH73La.jpg\",\"media_type\":\"tv\",\"original_language\":\"ja\",\"genre_ids\":[16,18],\"popularity\":4.1792,\"first_air_date\":\"2025-10-08\",\"vote_average\":0,\"vote_count\":0,\"origin_country\":[\"JP\"]},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/krZyxxsbjqWYuNFAQsGaq9KLA9g.jpg\",\"id\":262928,\"name\":\"Love in the Clouds\",\"original_name\":\"入青云\",\"overview\":\"At the annual Qingyun Conference in the Hexu Six Realms, Ji Bozai, a warrior from the Jixing Abyss with a past as a convict, defeated Ming Yi, the cold warrior goddess who had reigned supreme for seven consecutive years. Overnight, Ji Bozai became the hottest new star in Jixing Abyss. Meanwhile, Ming Yi, hiding her true identity, disguised herself as a dancer to get close to Ji Bozai. Under their carefully crafted personas, the two engaged in a thrilling dance of deception and attraction, fighting for justice and fairness, and ultimately found a deep and moving love.\",\"poster_path\":\"/alXAb26apN2tbRM91QjeZ0KzHlj.jpg\",\"media_type\":\"tv\",\"original_language\":\"zh\",\"genre_ids\":[18,10765],\"popularity\":13.2557,\"first_air_date\":\"2025-10-08\",\"vote_average\":0,\"vote_count\":0,\"origin_country\":[\"CN\"]},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/bKxiLRPVWe2nZXCzt6JPr5HNWYm.jpg\",\"id\":110316,\"name\":\"Alice in Borderland\",\"original_name\":